.IP \(bu 2
The returned string must be freed with \f[CR]bc_free()\f[R], not
standard \f[CR]free()\f[R].
While they may be equivalent in the current implementation, using
\f[CR]bc_free()\f[R] ensures correct behavior if the library\(cqs
