.IP \(bu 2
There is no \f[CR]bc_state_set_func()\f[R] in the client library.
To define or replace a shell function, use \f[CR]bc_eval()\f[R] with the
function definition syntax (e.g.,
\f[CR]\(dqmyfunc() { commands; }\(dq\f[R]).
.IP \(bu 2
The function definition string may contain newlines and embedded special
