It is the raw bash function body, not escaped for any particular output
format.
.IP \(bu 2
The function uses the v2 binary protocol internally.
The STATE channel request is a JSON object with
\f[CR]\(dqop\(dq: \(dqget\(dq\f[R], \f[CR]\(dqns\(dq: \(dqfunc\(dq\f[R],
and \f[CR]\(dqname\(dq\f[R] fields.
.IP \(bu 2
A single \f[CR]bc_client_t\f[R] must not be used concurrently from
